          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anigu waxaan ahay Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah oo dalkii Masar idiinka soo bixiyey inuu Ilaah idiin ahaado. Aniga ayaa ah Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
